  Contents: one DAC attribute override, and (pending) one screen layout change.
  This file deliberately carries no pageSource snapshot of PO302000.aspx: that
  markup belongs to Acumatica and is not redistributed here. Acumatica's editor
  writes a pageSource attribute on every Page item; whether a Page item imports
